<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague basketball championship matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Sevilla:</p>
<p>Sevilla (Spain) 72 Kinder Bologna (Italy) 64 (halftime 30-37)  </p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Athens:</p>
<p>Olympiakos (Greece) 87 Charleroi (Belgium) 60 (50-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Olympiakos - David Rivers 18, Panayotis Fasoulas 15</p>
<p>Charleroi - Leron Ellis 19, Adam Woitzik 13</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Limoges</p>
<p>Limoges (France) 78 Panionios (Greece) 75 (40-40)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Limoges - Yann Bonato 24, Gerald Glas 15, Frederic Forte 14</p>
<p>Panionios: Mitchell Wiggins 16, Keith Gaitlin 15, Gerrit</p>
<p>Hammink 12.</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Bologna:</p>
<p>Teamsystem Bologna (Italy) beat Estudiantes Madrid (Spain)</p>
<p>100-68 (49-31)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bologna - McRae 16, Ruggieri 14, Vescovi 13, Blasi 13</p>
<p>Estudiantes - Barcenas 15, Thompson 13, Aisa 13, De Miguel</p>
<p>11, Martinez 11.</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Moscow:</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 73 Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 82  (41-47)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow - Maksim Astanin 21</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Petar Naumovski 37, Vasili Karasev 11</p>
<p>In Pau:</p>
<p>Pau-Orthez (France) 73 Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia) 77 (40-34)</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Pau - Fabien Dubos 20, Antoine Rigaudeau 19, Laurent Foirest 14</p>
<p>Belgrade - Miroslav Beric 20, Dragan Lukovski 18, Dejan Koturovic 10</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,500 MORE PSE  </p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Berlin:</p>
<p>Alba Berlin (Germany) 79 Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 71 (39-33).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Alba Berlin - Obradovic 17, Hupmann 15</p>
<p>Zagreb - Mulaomerovic 20, Radulovic 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,821</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Split:</p>
<p>Split (Croatia) 86 Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 79 (37-37)</p>
